# Eventos — Sistema Completo

## Arquitectura

| Archivo | Propósito |
|---|---|
| `event/EventEngine.java` | Singleton: scheduler, alternancia con Faction War |
| `event/AbstractEvent.java` | Clase base para eventos: register, start, stop, rewards |
| `event/EventConfig.java` | Carga config de eventos |
| `event/EventPlayer.java` | Wrapper Player + datos de evento |
| `event/events/TvT.java` | Team vs Team |
| `event/events/DM.java` | Deathmatch |
| `event/events/CTF.java` | Capture the Flag |
| `event/events/BombFight.java` | Bomb Fight |
| `event/events/LuckyChests.java` | Lucky Chests |
| `event/events/Domination.java` | Domination |
| `event/events/SimonSays.java` | Simon Says |
| `event/events/RaidInTheMiddle.java` | Raid in the Middle |

## Flujo

1. Alternancia con Faction War: war → eventos → war → eventos...
2. EventEngine.runScheduler() cada 1 minuto
3. Si FW no está activo, selecciona evento aleatorio
4. Registration → players join via NPC o .eventjoin
5. Start → teleport a zona, teams asignados
6. Running → players compiten
7. Stop → rewards al ganador

